reasons=['The actual table associates encoder angle with IK, torque with fault detection and load-cell force with grasp control.','The actual listed examples are suction pressure and the welding current/voltage/feed-rate row.','Stratification controls class proportions; random_state fixes pseudorandom splitting.','Fit scaling statistics only on training data and apply them unchanged to held-out inputs.','An RBF feature-space linear separator can induce nonlinear input-space boundaries; affine standardization alone cannot do that.','Standardization gives(1,-1,1), squared distances0and3, kernels1and.5, score2-.5-1.25=.25, hence overload.','Class1 maps to overload in the ordered target_names; support counts true labels.','Macro recall=(.9+.5)/2=.7; weighted recall=(80*.9+20*.5)/100=.82.','No literal choice is justified for the misquoted call: the actual slide says mglearn.plots.plot_single_hidden_layer_graph(), with plots. After explicitly repairing the path, the generic diagram does not configure or fit the later regressor.','Relative elbow gives theta1+theta2=pi/2; endpoint=(sqrt3/2,1.5)m.','(0,pi/2) yields(1,1)m and meets nonnegative elbow; the other exact branch has a negative elbow.','The target radius sqrt(1.5²+1.5²)=sqrt4.5 exceeds the total2m link reach.','Rounded display angles and coordinates need not exactly agree with hidden full-precision slider state.','A reaches the point but violates the branch; B/C have equal angle MSE but Cartesian errors about.732m/.518m, so chooseC.','Layer parameter counts768+65792+32896+258=99714.','Raw component norms are.05and0, numeric mean.025; multiplying100prints2.50cm, but.025mm=.0025cm physically.','(pi/2,pi/2) yields(-1,1)m and belongs to the positive-elbow branch.','FK of the two rounded historical angles gives Euclidean residual about.15744m, or15.74cm; not the test-set mean9.82cm.','With nonzero links the sine factor vanishes at elbow0andpi; pi/2isnot singular for planar position.']
